 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** Discrete volume data samples $f_k$ at positions $kT$.
-*   **Output:** Reconstructed continuous signal $\tilde{f}(t)$ evaluated at arbitrary positions.
-*   **Intermediate:** Prefiltered coefficients $c_k$.
+*   **Input:** Discrete volume data samples $f_k$ at positions $kT$ [S1].
+*   **Output:** Reconstructed continuous signal $\tilde{f}(t)$ evaluated at arbitrary positions [S1].
+*   **Intermediate:** Prefiltered coefficients $c_k$ [S1].
 
